# This env file should be checked into source control
# This is the place for default values for all environments
# Values in `.env.local` and `.env.production` will override these values
# DATABASE_URL is the URL of the database server
# RESEND_API_KEY is the API key for the Resend email service
# SESSION_SECRET_KEY is the secret key used to sign session cookies
# PIPELINE_PYTHON is the path to the Python executable used for the pipeline